# Exam Cheat Detection System - Complete Project Understanding

## 🎯 Project Overview

**Real-Time Cheating Detection System for Exams** - A computer vision-based web application that monitors exam takers in real-time using YOLO object detection, MediaPipe pose estimation, and behavioral analysis to detect suspicious activities during exams.

### Core Objectives
- Detect cheating behaviors in real-time using only visual input (no audio/biometrics)
- Provide interpretable alerts with visual and textual explanations
- Reduce manual supervision by automating monitoring
- Store flagged events with snapshots and metadata for instructor review
- Minimize false positives using temporal smoothing and multi-signal fusion
- Ensure privacy by retaining only flagged frames and deleting non-events

### Team
- **Dev A:** Aladdin Ghribi
- **Dev B:** Malak Khalaf

