## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

### Technology Stack
- **Backend:** Flask + Flask-SocketIO (WebSocket for real-time communication)
- **Computer Vision:**
  - YOLO11 (nano/small/medium models) for object detection
  - MediaPipe Pose for pose estimation and head orientation
  - OpenCV for image processing
- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, JavaScript with Socket.IO
- **Deep Learning:** PyTorch (with CUDA support for GPU acceleration)

### System Components

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     Web Interface (Flask)                    │
│  - Real-time video streaming via WebSocket                  │
│  - Interactive controls and threshold adjustment             │
│  - Seat map visualization and event logging                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Detection Pipeline                        │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐      │
│  │ YOLO Detector│→ │Object Tracker│→ │Seat Manager  │      │
│  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘      │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐      │
│  │Pose Detector │→ │Suspicion     │→ │Evidence Saver│      │
│  └──────────────┘  └──Scorer──────┘  └──────────────┘      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

