## 🌐 Web Application ([app.py](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/start_app.py))

### Flask Routes

1. **`/` (GET)** - Serve dashboard HTML
2. **`/upload` (POST)** - Handle file uploads (images/videos)
3. **`/process_file` (POST)** - Process uploaded files
4. **`/download/<filename>` (GET)** - Download exported data
5. **`/api/historical_events` (GET)** - Fetch saved events

### WebSocket Events

**Client → Server:**
- [video_frame](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#49-174) - Send frame for processing
- [update_suspicion_threshold](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#264-270) - Change alert threshold
- [toggle_auto_save](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#271-277) - Enable/disable auto-save
- [switch_model](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#278-285) - Change YOLO model
- [toggle_frame_skipping](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#286-292) - Enable/disable frame skipping
- [manual_save](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#293-315) - Save current frame manually
- [export_data](file:///c:/Users/Mega_pc/Desktop/Exam-cheat-detection/src/cheat_detection_web_app/app.py#316-367) - Export events (JSON/CSV/ZIP)

**Server → Client:**
- `processed_frame` - Return annotated frame + detections
- `threshold_updated` - Confirm threshold change
- `save_notification` - Notify save status
- `export_ready` - Provide download link

### Processing Pipeline

```
1. Receive frame via WebSocket
2. Decode base64 image
3. Run YOLO detection
4. Track objects (assign IDs)
5. Update seat assignments
6. Detect pose (if enabled)
7. Calculate suspicion scores
8. Save evidence (if threshold exceeded)
9. Annotate frame
10. Send results back to client
```

