## 📊 Performance Characteristics

### Processing Speed
- **Target:** ~10 FPS (50ms intervals)
- **YOLO inference:** 30-50ms per frame
- **Pose detection:** 20-40ms per frame
- **Total pipeline:** 70-90ms per frame

### Hardware Requirements
- **Minimum:** i5 8th gen, 8GB RAM (8-12 FPS with optimizations)
- **Recommended:** RTX 3070, 16GB RAM (15+ FPS)

### Optimizations Applied
- Reduced image size (1344 → 640 for CPU)
- Model complexity 0 for pose detection
- Frame skipping when processing is slow
- Auto device detection (GPU/CPU)
- Temporal smoothing to reduce false positives

---

## 🔐 Privacy & Data Management

### Privacy Features
- **Selective Storage:** Only flagged frames saved (score ≥ 20)
- **Auto-Deletion:** Evidence older than 7 days removed
- **Event Limit:** Maximum 100 events retained (FIFO)
- **No Biometrics:** No facial recognition or audio recording
- **Access Control:** Evidence restricted to authorized instructors

### Data Retention Policy
- Flagged events: 7 days maximum
- Non-flagged frames: Immediately discarded
- Maximum storage: 100 events
- Manual saves: Marked in metadata

